stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> awaiting_approval: preparePayouts
  awaiting_approval --> approved: passkey approval, caps, balance
  awaiting_approval --> failed: discarded (stale or replaced)
  approved --> order_created: Paycrest order created, after the Base hop delivered
  approved --> funding: Pretium cash-out or USDC payout passes barrier
  approved --> failed: paused, quote error, wallet inactive, refused, Base hop or delivery quote refunded or failed, no order in 15 min
  approved --> needs_review: ambiguous createOrder, no order id after 2 min, Base hop in review
  order_created --> funding: funding barrier passed
  order_created --> failed: checkOrder fails, paused, expired, cancelled
  order_created --> needs_review: unexpected Paycrest status
  funding --> paying: USDC sent or deposit ran
  funding --> paid: 1Click delivered
  funding --> failed: send refused, quote refunded
  funding --> needs_review: send outcome unknown, over 10 min, expired
  paying --> paid: Paycrest validated or settled, Pretium complete, or payee chain delivery confirmed
  paying --> failed: provider refunded (USDC back as a refund row), or 1Click refunded the deposit
  paying --> needs_review: over 2 h, mismatch
  needs_review --> paid: staff resolve with second confirmation
  needs_review --> failed: staff resolve with second confirmation
  paid --> [*]
  failed --> [*]
  note right of approved
    A KES cash-out stays approved
    while its Base hop is under way
  end note
  note right of failed
    Retry creates a new payout for the same subject
    with a new key and needs a fresh approval
  end note
